      <level1>
        <h1>Chapter 1: Prose, Typography &amp; Inline Mathematics</h1>
        <level2>
          <h2>1.1 Semantic Text &amp; Typeforms</h2>
          <p>This paragraph illustrates full typography support under BANA and UEB formatting standards. Words can have <strong>bold emphasis</strong>, <em>italic emphasis</em>, or <span class="underline">underline styling</span>. Multiple typeforms can also be combined such as <em><strong>bold italicized terms</strong></em>.</p>
        </level2>
        <level2>
          <h2>1.2 Inline and Display Mathematics (MathML 3)</h2>
          <p>Mathematical expressions are encoded with standard W3C MathML: The quadratic formula is represented as <m:math alttext="x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}" altimg="math.png"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>&#177;</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>&#8290;</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>&#8290;</m:mo><m:mi>c</m:mi></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>&#8290;</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mrow></m:math>, and the Pythagorean identity is <m:math alttext="a^2 + b^2 = c^2" altimg="math.png"><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msup><m:mi>c</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup></m:mrow></m:math>.</p>
