      <level1>
        <h1>Chapter 2: Structural Collections, Tables &amp; Sidebars</h1>
        <level2>
          <h2>2.1 Hierarchical Lists</h2>
          <p>Key science exploration topics:</p>
          <list type="ul">
            <li><strong>Astronomy:</strong> Stellar evolution, black holes, and spectroscopy.</li>
            <li><strong>Geology:</strong> Plate tectonics, mineral crystallization, and seismic fault lines.</li>
            <li><strong>Biology:</strong> Cellular respiration, photosynthesis, and genetics.</li>
          </list>
          <p>Chronological lab sequence:</p>
          <list type="ol">
            <li>Calibrate the electronic analytical balance.</li>
            <li>Measure 25.0 mL of aqueous sodium bicarbonate.</li>
            <li>Record temperature fluctuations over 10-second intervals.</li>
          </list>
        </level2>
